    'High CLS (font swap jumps)': 'next/font — self-hosts and size-adjusts fallbacks to avoid shift',
    'Poor INP (sluggish taps)': 'Minimize client JS — Server Components + dynamic import smaller bundle',
    'Slow TTFB (per-request work)': 'Static/ISR caching + streaming — serve from CDN, unblock slow data',
